 @cenunix  I tried using Plex and it literally wouldn't let me play my own media that I'm hosting locally without an Internet connection. The fact that it wanted to "phone home" just to let me watch movies that were on drives literally 10 feet away from me was enough to make me drop them. 
That, plus the data breaches (there was another one this week), constant push to try and commercialize their business, and the fact that they're not open source means I'm not letting that spyware anywhere near my machines.
I guess it is easier to set up for the more tech-illiterate people out there who don't care about their privacy tho.
